"<p>Krecipes can import nutrient data from the USDA's nutrient database for "
"over 400 foods.  A total of 43 food properties are included for each food, "
"such as energy, fat, vitamin C, etc.</p><p>Would you like to import this "
"data now?  Note that this operation is safe to use on an existing database, "
"and no data loss will occur.  This operation may take several minutes.</p>"
msgstr ""
"KRecipes kann Eteninholtdaten för mehr as 400 Etensaken ut de USDA ehr "
"Eteninholt-Datenbank importeren. För elk Etensaak sünd 43 Egenschappen "
"inslaten, so as Energie, Fett, Vitamien C usw.<br><br>Wullt Du disse Daten "
"nu importeren? Du kannst dat ok doon, wenn Du al wat binnen Dien Datenbank "
"hest, Di kaamt dor keen bi Daten weg. De Akschoon mag en poor Minuten bruken."

#: setupassistant.cpp:796
